{
  "$schema": "https://jxsuite.com/schema/v1",
  "$id": "StudioDiffToolbar",
  "$description": "The Compare view's own bar: which half of a comparison is showing, how many changes there are, and how to walk them. `canvas/diff-toolbar.ts` keeps every decision — what the count means for the view that is showing, which step is reachable, whether this comparison has a visual half at all — and this document owns the markup, the ARIA, the keyboard and the style. The Visual/Code pair is a real radiogroup now rather than a role written by hand over a Spectrum button that overwrote it: `jx-action-group selects=\"single\"` is the group and `checked` is what makes each `jx-action-button` a radio, so the caret roves between them and `aria-checked` is the element's own rather than an attribute the template hoped would survive an upgrade.",
  "tagName": "div",
  "attributes": {
    "part": "toolbar",
    "role": "group",
    "aria-label": "Changes against HEAD"
  },
  "style": {
    "$description": "`styles/canvas.css`'s `.diff-toolbar-inner` and the three text runs under it, keyed on `part`. The bar's POSITION is not here: the stage draws the absolutely-positioned host this mounts into (`surfaces/canvas-stage.json`, `[part=\"diff-toolbar\"]`), because where a floating bar sits over a pan/zoom surface is a fact about the stage rather than about the bar.",
    "display": "flex",
    "gap": "var(--jx-space-2)",
    "alignItems": "center",
    "padding": "4px var(--jx-space-2)",
    "border": "1px solid var(--border)",
    "borderRadius": "var(--radius)",
    "background": "var(--bg)",
    "boxShadow": "var(--jx-shadow-popover)",
    "fontFamily": "var(--jx-font-sans)",
    "& [part=\"view\"]": {
      "$description": "Spacing only: the segmented look is `jx-action-group`'s own `compact`, exactly as it was Spectrum's.",
      "flexShrink": "0"
    },
    "& [part=\"view-static\"], & [part=\"count\"], & [part=\"note\"]": {
      "color": "var(--fg)",
      "fontSize": "var(--jx-text-sm)",
      "whiteSpace": "nowrap"
    },
    "& [part=\"count\"]": {
      "$description": "Tabular figures so the counter does not jitter its neighbours as it steps.",
      "fontVariantNumeric": "tabular-nums"
    },
    "& [part=\"note\"]": {
      "color": "var(--fg-dim)"
    },
    "& [part=\"stepper\"]": {
      "display": "flex",
      "alignItems": "center",
      "gap": "var(--jx-space-2)"
    }
  },
  "children": [
    {
      "$description": "The Visual/Code pair, or a static label. A control that cannot move is not drawn as a control — the rule `editorKindTpl` states for a document with one editor kind — so a comparison the canvas cannot draw says \"Code\" in words rather than offering a Visual button it would have to disable.",
      "tagName": "div",
      "attributes": {
        "part": "view-slot"
      },
      "style": {
        "display": "contents"
      },
      "$switch": {
        "$ref": "#/state/viewMode"
      },
      "cases": {
        "static": {
          "tagName": "span",
          "attributes": {
            "part": "view-static"
          },
          "textContent": "Code"
        },
        "choice": {
          "tagName": "jx-action-group",
          "attributes": {
            "part": "view"
          },
          "$props": {
            "selects": "single",
            "compact": true,
            "label": "Diff view"
          },
          "children": [
            {
              "tagName": "jx-action-button",
              "attributes": {
                "part": "view-visual"
              },
              "$props": {
                "size": "sm",
                "checked": "${state.visualChecked}",
                "hint": "Show the change on the page"
              },
              "onclick": {
                "$prototype": "Function",
                "body": [
                  {
                    "operator": "call",
                    "target": { "$ref": "#/state/showVisual" },
                    "value": []
                  }
                ]
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tagName": "span",
                  "textContent": "Visual"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "tagName": "jx-action-button",
              "attributes": {
                "part": "view-code"
              },
              "$props": {
                "size": "sm",
                "checked": "${state.codeChecked}",
                "hint": "Show the change in the file's text"
              },
              "onclick": {
                "$prototype": "Function",
                "body": [
                  {
                    "operator": "call",
                    "target": { "$ref": "#/state/showCode" },
                    "value": []
                  }
                ]
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tagName": "span",
                  "textContent": "Code"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "$description": "The count, and — only when there is somewhere to step — the two buttons around it. Before the first step it reads \"12 changes\" rather than \"0 of 12\", because the author is not on a change yet. The counter is text rather than a button because it has no verb.",
      "tagName": "div",
      "attributes": {
        "part": "stepper-slot"
      },
      "style": {
        "display": "contents"
      },
      "$switch": {
        "$ref": "#/state/stepper"
      },
      "cases": {
        "hidden": {
          "tagName": "span",
          "attributes": {
            "part": "count"
          },
          "textContent": "${state.countLabel}"
        },
        "shown": {
          "tagName": "span",
          "attributes": {
            "part": "stepper"
          },
          "children": [
            {
              "tagName": "jx-action-button",
              "attributes": {
                "part": "previous"
              },
              "$props": {
                "size": "sm",
                "quiet": true,
                "icon": "caret-up",
                "label": "Previous change",
                "hint": "Previous change",
                "disabled": { "$ref": "#/state/prevDisabled" }
              },
              "onclick": {
                "$prototype": "Function",
                "body": [
                  {
                    "operator": "call",
                    "target": { "$ref": "#/state/previous" },
                    "value": []
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "tagName": "span",
              "attributes": {
                "part": "count"
              },
              "textContent": "${state.countLabel}"
            },
            {
              "tagName": "jx-action-button",
              "attributes": {
                "part": "next"
              },
              "$props": {
                "size": "sm",
                "quiet": true,
                "icon": "caret-down",
                "label": "Next change",
                "hint": "Next change",
                "disabled": { "$ref": "#/state/nextDisabled" }
              },
              "onclick": {
                "$prototype": "Function",
                "body": [
                  {
                    "operator": "call",
                    "target": { "$ref": "#/state/next" },
                    "value": []
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "$description": "The alignment was degraded: a group of siblings was too large to pair up, so some changes are shown as an add and a remove rather than as one modification. Reported rather than hidden — a reader counting changes deserves to know the count is coarser than usual.",
      "tagName": "div",
      "attributes": {
        "part": "degraded-slot"
      },
      "style": {
        "display": "contents"
      },
      "$switch": {
        "$ref": "#/state/degraded"
      },
      "cases": {
        "shown": {
          "tagName": "span",
          "attributes": {
            "part": "note",
            "title": "A group of siblings was too large to pair up"
          },
          "textContent": "some shown as add/remove"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "$description": "A root key moved — `state`, `$media`, a document setting. Those are never tinted on the artboards, because they have no node to tint, so the bar states them in words and the tooltip names them.",
      "tagName": "div",
      "attributes": {
        "part": "root-keys-slot"
      },
      "style": {
        "display": "contents"
      },
      "$switch": {
        "$ref": "#/state/rootKeys"
      },
      "cases": {
        "shown": {
          "tagName": "span",
          "attributes": {
            "part": "note",
            "title": "${state.rootKeysTitle}"
          },
          "textContent": "document settings changed"
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
